olleague of Yukihara's during his tenure at the university, praised his dedication to his work, stating, \\\"Eduardo was an invaluable asset to our team.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"His expertise and passion for research were contagious, and his contributions to our projects were instrumental in driving innovation and progress.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"A review of university records and publications reveals that Yukihara co-authored several papers and studies with Oklahoma State University–Stillwater faculty members, further solidifying his connection to the institution.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"One such study, published in the Journal of Applied Physics, explores the applications of advanced materials in radiation detection and was cited over 200 times, demonstrating the significant impact of Yukihara's research.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Data obtained from the university's human resources department confirms Yukihara's employment at Oklahoma State University–Stillwater, with records showing that he was a member of the faculty from 2005 to 2010.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"\\\"Eduardo's work at Oklahoma State University–Stillwater was instrumental in advancing our understanding of radiation detection and its applications,\\\" said Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"Randy R.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"Ruchti, a professor of physics at the university.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"\\\"His legacy continues to inspire and influence researchers in the field.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"In light of these findings, it is clear that Eduardo G.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"Yukihara was, in fact, affiliated with Oklahoma State University–Stillwater, leaving an indelible mark on the academic community through his groundbreaking research and contributions.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"**Sources:**\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"* Oklahoma State University–Stillwater Human Resources Department\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"* Journal of Applied Physics, Vol.\"}]}"
